ance SDK."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Asynchronously initializes the Sentiance SDK, thereby preparing it to resume detections if a Sentiance user exists"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and if detections were last enabled. If a user does not exist, this method does only minimal work to allow user"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"creation. To create a user, call createUserWithOptions:completionHandler:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is the asynchronous variant of the initializeWithOptions:launchOptions: method. Use this variant if you want"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to minimize the impact of the SDK initialization on the startup duration of your app. However, note that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"interacting with most Sentiance SDK APIs requires an initialized SDK. Therefore, make sure to handle a delayed or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"failed initialization in other parts of your app, by utilizing the result returned to the completion handler."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To ensure proper continuity of SDK detections across app restarts, this method must still be called on the main"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"thread, inside [AppDelegate application:application didFinishLaunchingWithOptions:launchOptions], before it returns."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This method must not be called asynchronously, as doing so does not guarantee that it will be invoked before"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"application:didFinishLaunchingWithOptions: completes."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For more details on this, see: https:\/\/docs.sentiance.com\/important-topics\/sdk\/appendix\/sdk-async-initialization","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Most SDK methods require an initialized SDK before being invoked, otherwise they throw a runtime exception."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Methods excluded from this requirement mention this in their respective documentation."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"fail with reason SENTInitializationFailureReasonReinitializationNotAllowed, unless a user does not exist yet (e.g.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"before user creation or after an SDK reset), in which case multiple initializations are still allowed.","type":"text"}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/sentsdk\/sentiance\/initializeasync(with:launchoptions:completionhandler:)"]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/sentsdk\/sentiance\/initializeasync(with:launchoptions:completionhandler:)"]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"SENTSDK"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"initializeAsync"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"with"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)SENTOptions","text":"SENTOptions"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"launchOptions"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s11AnyHashableV","text":"AnyHashable"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"Any"},{"kind":"text","text":"]?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"completionHandler"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)SENTAsyncInitializationResult","text":"SENTAsyncInitializationResult"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)SENTAsyncInitializationError","text":"SENTAsyncInitializationError"},{"kind":"text","tex